& [Forms]
  + RepositoryStitchProjectionRequest retains profile identities input class exact RSO request receipt verification downstream identities provider profile invocation boundary evidence nonauthority and request digest
  + RepositoryStitchProjectionReceipt binds every upstream and downstream digest selected stitch hint source observation coordinate projection projected-byte historical-contact and current-effect account
  + RepositoryStitchProjectionEnvelope retains exact request derived SjsLasRequest SjsLasEnvelope SjsLasVerification receipt execution_authorized false zero current effects and envelope digest
  + RepositoryStitchProjectionVerification independently reports exact status counts lineage digests historical contact current effects and authorization
  + four-file evidence manifest binds exact raw request envelope verification manifest bytes and replay counts

& [Canonicalization]
  + selected candidates and derived stitches sort by stitch identity; source sets and predicate text sets are canonical ordered sets
  + identity derivation changes only the semantic prefix while retaining the validated UUID component
  + copied strings predicates source bindings and candidate fields remain byte-exact UTF-8 values
  + digests are domain-separated for request receipt envelope verification evidence and published downstream forms

& [Cardinality]
  + selected candidates one through sixteen stitches one through sixteen hints exactly one per stitch sources exactly one per stitch observations exactly one per stitch coordinates exactly one projections exactly one evidence files exactly four
